[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0818","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0818.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1127","title":"HP HP-UX registrar 本地任意文件读取漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.20 操作系统的资源监控服务 registrar 存在本地任意文件读取漏洞。该漏洞原理是 registrar 在记录日志时未对日志文件路径进行安全校验，本地攻击者可先将原始 registrar.log 日志文件重命名，再创建指向任意目标文件的符号链接，使 registrar 将日志信息追加写入该目标文件并设置全局可读权限。攻击条件为拥有本地系统访问权限，利用方式简单，可导致任意文件被读取或篡改，造成敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1127"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:12Z","remediation":"立即应用 HP 官方安全补丁 PHNE_22779（适用于 HP-UX 10.20），或升级至已修复该漏洞的 HP-UX 11.00 及以上版本。如无法打补丁，可执行以下缓解措施：(1) 将 /etc/opt/resmon/log 目录权限改为 750 或更严格，防止非授权用户执行 mv 操作；(2) 在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 registrar 服务行并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务；(3) 使用 chmod 644 确保 registrar.log 文件创建时权限安全，并定期审计日志目录的符号链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/143845","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1919","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20386","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1127","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2000/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1127.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1127.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1127.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0818.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0818.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0818.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0816","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0816.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1125","title":"RedHat Red Hat Linux 6.2 restore 环境变量信任本地提权漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 系统中的 restore 工具（0.4b15 及更早版本）存在不安全的路径处理漏洞。该工具在执行过程中信任 RSH 环境变量所指定的路径名，未对路径进行合法性验证。本地攻击者可通过修改 RSH 环境变量使其指向自身控制的恶意程序（特洛伊木马），当 restore 工具以 root 权限执行时会调用该恶意程序，从而获取系统 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 系统中所有使用该版本 restore 工具的用户，攻击条件为攻击者拥有本地访问权限。利用方式为修改 RSH 环境变量并触发 restore 命令执行，最终实现本地权限提升至 root。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1125"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:12Z","remediation":"升级 restore 软件包至已修复版本，或升级至 Red Hat Linux 更新的受支持版本。临时缓解措施：以 root 权限编辑 /etc/profile 及所有用户 shell 配置文件，取消 RSH 环境变量的默认设置，执行 unset RSH 或 export RSH=/usr/bin/rsh 将其固定为安全路径。同时通过 chmod 移除 restore 二进制文件的 SUID 权限，仅允许 root 用户直接执行该程序，防止普通用户利用该漏洞提升权限至 root。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97336034309944&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1914","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1125.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1125.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1125","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1125.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1125.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1125.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb4fa88be1e2cec066471c94ef8377b081c79cb6/2000/CVE-2000-1125.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1125.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1125.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1125.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0816.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0815","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0815.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1124","title":"IBM AIX piobe 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 系统中的 piobe 命令（位于 /usr/lib/lpd/piobe）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于该命令在处理环境变量时未对输入长度进行有效边界检查，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖栈内存并劫持程序执行流程。该漏洞允许本地未授权用户提升自身权限至超级用户级别，从而完全控制受影响的系统。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 4.3.x 版本，攻击条件要求攻击者已具备对系统的本地访问权限，利用方式为在调用 piobe 命令时通过长环境变量触发溢出，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级高。IBM 已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议受影响用户升级至更高版本或应用相应补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1124"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 IBM 针对 CVE-2000-1124 发布的 APAR 修复包 IY12638，可通过 IBM Fix Central 下载对应 AIX 4.3.x 版本的补丁并执行 installp 命令安装。安装完成后使用 oslevel -s 或 lslpp -l bos.rte.printers 验证补丁版本已更新，然后执行 stopsrc -g spooler 和 startsrc -g spooler 重启打印子系统使修复生效。作为临时缓解措施，可修改 /etc/security/login.cfg 限制非特权用户对 piobe 命令的执行权限，或通过 chmod 移除 /usr/lib/lpd/piobe 的 setuid 位以阻断提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY12638&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2037","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5616","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20455","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1124","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb4fa88be1e2cec066471c94ef8377b081c79cb6/2000/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1124.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1124.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1124.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0815.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0814","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0814.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1121","title":"IBM AIX enq 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 及更早版本中的 enq 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。enq 命令在处理 -M 参数时未对输入长度进行有效边界检查，本地用户通过向 -M 参数传递超长字符串可触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，最终导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 4.3.x 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。成功利用后攻击者可获取目标系统的完全控制权限，实现任意命令执行。目前已存在公开的本地利用程序（ExploitDB ID: 20454），进一步降低了利用门槛。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1121"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 IBM 针对 APAR IX69619 发布的 PTF 补丁，或升级 AIX 系统至 4.3.3 Maintenance Level 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可通过移除 enq 命令的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/enq）作为临时缓解措施，但可能影响打印队列管理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08143&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08287&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2034","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5619","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20454","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1121.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1121","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1121.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1121.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1121.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-1121.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1121.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1121.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1121.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1121.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0814.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0814.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0814.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0813","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0813.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1120","title":"IBM AIX 4.3 digest 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 及更早版本中的 digest 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 digest 命令传入特制的参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 4.3 系列操作系统，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前已有公开的本地缓冲区溢出利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1120"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 IBM APAR IY17249 修复 digest 命令缓冲区溢出问题，或升级 AIX 系统至 4.3.3 及以上维护版本。如无法立即打补丁，可临时移除 /usr/lib/lpd/digest 文件的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/lib/lpd/digest），限制非授权用户执行该命令作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08143&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08287&apar=only","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2033","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5620","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20453","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1120","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1120.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1120.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1120.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0813.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0812","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0812.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1119","title":"IBM AIX setsenv 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 及更早版本中的 setsenv 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 setsenv 命令传入过长的\"x=\"参数触发堆栈缓冲区溢出，从而在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 AIX 4.x 系列操作系统，攻击者需要具备本地登录权限或本地 shell 访问权限才能利用此漏洞。成功利用后，攻击者可在系统上下文中执行任意代码，可能导致敏感数据泄露、权限提升或系统被进一步控制，CVSS 评分为 4.6。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1119"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:11Z","remediation":"安装 IBM 官方 APAR 补丁 IY08812（AIX 4.3.x）或 IY10721（AIX 4.2.x），或升级至 AIX 4.3.3 及更高版本。临时缓解措施可执行命令 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/setsenv` 移除该程序的 setuid 位，限制普通用户执行权限，并定期审查系统 setuid/setgid 程序列表。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97569466809056&w=2","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY08812&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY10721&apar=only","http://www.osvdb.org/1676","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2032","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5621","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20452","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1119","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1119.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1119.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2000-1119.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0812.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0811","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0811.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1116","title":"TransSoft Broker FTP Server 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"TransSoft Broker FTP Server 3.0.x 及 4.0 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 FTP 服务器发送超长的用户名命令触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，并可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 TransSoft Broker FTP Server 4.3.0.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可利用，无需任何权限，利用复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1116"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10Z","remediation":"升级 TransSoft Broker FTP Server 至 4.3.0.1 或更高版本以修复用户名缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，在防火墙或网络层面限制对 FTP 服务（默认端口 21）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并监控异常长度的 FTP 命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0041.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5388","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19611","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1116.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1116.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1116","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1116.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1116.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1116.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d2b90135469e518b8bd9c7142a1d639da966b67/2000/CVE-2000-1116.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1116.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1116.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1116.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0811.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0810","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0810.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1114","title":"Unify eWave ServletExec 3 JSP 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Unify eWave ServletExec AS v3.0C 存在 JSP 源代码泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送以特殊字符（如 \".\", \"+\" 或 \"%20\"）结尾的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过 ServletExec 的访问控制机制，导致服务器返回 JSP 文件的原始源代码而非执行后的结果。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，从而获取 Web 应用的后端逻辑、数据库连接信息等敏感数据，为后续攻击提供情报支撑。该漏洞影响 Unify eWave ServletExec 3.0C 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1114"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 Unify eWave ServletExec 至 3.0D 或更高版本以修复 JSP 源代码泄露问题。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache/Netscape）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拒绝以 `.`、`+`、`%20`、`%00`、`%2E`、`%2B`、`%5C` 结尾的 JSP 请求；同时部署 WAF 规则拦截 `*.jsp[.+%\\00]` 模式，并限制对 JSP 目录的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0285.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1970","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20412","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1114","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7597ddfeff03aa9cd00b0ce83a368fad007497d9/2000/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1114.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1114.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1114.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0810.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0805","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0805.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1113","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 .ASX 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意 Active Stream Redirector (.asx) 文件向受害者发送攻击向量，利用整数溢出或堆内存 corruption 等内存 corruption 技术触发溢出，获取对目标系统的控制权。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Player 7.0，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程发起攻击，CVSS 评分 7.5，威胁等级中危。该漏洞最早在 2001 年 1 月被披露，攻击者可利用该漏洞在目标计算机上执行任意代码，窃取敏感数据或进一步横向移动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1113"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-090 提供的补丁：Windows Media Player 6.4 用户下载安装 KB280419 补丁（https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=9B94D3F0-9CF3-4A5F-8215-A221DDD923B0），Windows Media Player 7 用户下载安装对应补丁（https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=BAF62356-D717-4B8F-97E0-299A7697A083）。如无法打补丁，在 IE 安全设置中将 Internet 区域 ActiveX 控件和插件设为禁用，并配置为不自动打开 .ASX 文件；同时不要打开来源不明的 .ASX 文件或访问可疑网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a112300-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1980","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-090","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5574","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20427","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1113","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7597ddfeff03aa9cd00b0ce83a368fad007497d9/2000/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1113.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1113.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1113.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0805.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0805.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0805.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0802","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0802.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1112","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 任意脚本执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7.0 在处理自定义皮肤(.wms)文件时存在任意脚本执行漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本的特制 .wms 皮肤文件，诱使用户在 Windows Media Player 中加载该文件，从而在当前用户权限下执行任意脚本代码。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Player 7.0 版本，攻击成功后可导致系统被控制或敏感信息泄露。Microsoft 已在 MS00-090 安全公告中发布修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1112"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 为 Windows Media Player 7 发布的 MS00-090 安全补丁（下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=BAF62356-D717-4B8F-97E0-299A7697A083），该补丁禁止皮肤文件中执行任意 ActiveX 对象。如无法安装补丁，可在 IE 安全设置中将 Internet 区域 ActiveX 控件和插件设为禁用，并避免打开来源不明的 .wms/.wmz/.wmd 皮肤文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1976","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-090","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5575","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20424","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1112.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1112.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1112","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1112.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1112.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/63a203d15e6082e0a2448fddec7f93c9d2fb2463/2000/CVE-2000-1112.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1112.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1112.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1112.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1112.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0802.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0802.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0802.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0801","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0801.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1110","title":"IBM Net.Data 完整路径泄露漏洞","description":"IBM Net.Data 7.0 的 db2www 组件中的 document.d2w CGI 程序存在路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向该程序发送一个不存在的命令参数，即可触发服务器返回包含物理路径的错误信息，从而泄露 Web 服务器的绝对路径。该信息可被攻击者用于进一步探测系统目录结构，为后续攻击提供信息支撑。攻击条件简单，仅需目标开放 HTTP 服务且运行 Net.Data 组件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1110"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:10Z","remediation":"IBM Net.Data 产品已停止支持，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即将 Net.Data 升级到 7.0 以上版本（如 7.1），或迁移至 IBM HTTP Server 等替代产品。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置访问控制，限制对 document.d2w CGI 程序的访问，仅允许授权 IP 段访问，或在 httpd.conf 中添加 RewriteRule 拒绝所有对 document.d2w 的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0384.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2017","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20441","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1110","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2000/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1110.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1110.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1110.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0801.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0801.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0801.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0798","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0798.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1105","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Indexing Service 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 系统的 Indexing Service 中的 ixsso.query ActiveX 对象被错误标记为\"对脚本安全\"，导致远程攻击者可通过恶意网页嵌入脚本，利用该 ActiveX 对象探测访问者系统中特定文件是否存在，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击条件仅需目标用户使用 Internet Explorer 访问恶意网站，且系统启用了 Indexing Service 服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 系统，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1105"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09Z","remediation":"在 Internet Explorer 中为\"Internet\"和\"受信任的站点\"区域启用\"对标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件执行脚本\"设置为\"禁用\"；通过注册表设置 `ixsso.query` 控件的 Kill Bit（CLSID: {C0A9EE9B-AC7B-11D1-9A6E-006097C6BDBE}，将 Compatibility Flags DWORD 值设为 0x400）；如无需使用 Indexing Service，在服务管理器中停止并禁用 Indexing Service 服务；建议将 Windows 2000 系统升级到受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11）以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0074.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/144270","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1933","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20399","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2000/CVE-2000-1105.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1105","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1105.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2000/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1105.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1105.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0798.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0798.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0798.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0797","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0797.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1103","title":"BSDi rcvtty 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"BSDi 3.0/4.0 系统中的 rcvtty 程序在执行脚本前未正确丢弃特权（即未执行有效的权限降级），导致本地攻击者可通过在命令行中指定特洛伊木马脚本的方式，以提升后的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 BSDi 3.0 和 4.0 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，获取最高权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1103"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:09Z","remediation":"升级 BSD/OS 至 4.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 rcvtty 在执行脚本前未正确丢弃特权的问题。如无法升级，可执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/rcvtty` 移除 rcvtty 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解，或限制本地非授权用户登录系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/147120","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2009","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/202","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2000/CVE-2000-1103.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1103.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1103.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1103.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1103","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1103.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1103.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1103.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1103.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4b74475b4552ac50c2b0e9c897e19d52aaa35c66/2000/CVE-2000-1103.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0797.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0795","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0795.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1100","title":"Trlinux Postaci Webmail 配置文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"PostACI Webmail 1.1.3 默认安装配置将 /includes/global.inc 配置文件放置在 Web 根目录下，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，直接通过 HTTP GET 请求即可访问该文件，导致数据库用户名、密码等敏感配置信息泄露。攻击者可利用泄露的凭据进一步入侵数据库系统，危害数据安全与系统完整性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1100"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08Z","remediation":"将 /includes/global.inc 配置文件移出 Web 根目录（如移至 /etc/postaci/），并设置权限为 600（仅所有者可读写）。在 Apache 中通过 .htaccess 或 httpd.conf 添加 `<Files \"global.inc\"> Deny from all </Files>` 禁止直接访问。升级到已修复此问题的 Postaci 更高版本或迁移至其他受支持的 Webmail 系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0433.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2029","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20450","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1100","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2000/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1100.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1100.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0795.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0795.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0795.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0793","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0793.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1096","title":"Paul Vixie crontab 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Paul Vixie 开发的 crontab 工具在处理 `crontab -e` 编辑任务时，使用可预测的临时文件名，且未正确验证临时文件的所有权归属。具有 crontab 缓冲池目录写入权限的本地攻击者，可在受害者编辑 crontab 文件期间，创建全局可写的临时文件并篡改其内容，从而注入恶意命令并以受害者权限执行，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响使用 vixie-cron 的系统，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1096"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08Z","remediation":"升级 vixie-cron 至 3.0pl1-74 或更高版本，或使用发行版官方安全更新修复临时文件竞争条件。若无法立即升级，应将 /var/spool/cron 目录权限设置为 755 并确保仅 root 用户具有写权限，同时设置 umask 077 防止临时文件被其他用户访问。建议禁止非特权用户使用 crontab 命令，或改用 cronie 等替代实现。","status":